      "source_id": "20b25462-bdbe-47e7-950d-c55c8e29cc5e",
      "text": "I'll keep the quick-scan approach in mind. I've got a basic telescope and a phone app for tracking, but no real backup plan. I guess I'll just keep checking the sky and hope for the best. Do you think I should try a different location if the clouds don't clear?"
    },
